---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
import FAQ from '../components/FAQ.astro';
---
<Layout title="For employers" description="Plan your workforce recruitment with a clear employer checklist, a practical recruitment journey, and answers to common questions.">
  <section class="page-heading container"><p class="eyebrow">FOR EMPLOYERS IN SRI LANKA</p><h1>A clear brief.<br/><em>A considered process.</em></h1><div class="page-heading-bottom"><p>You know the work that needs doing. We help you take the next step towards finding suitable people.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Start your enquiry <Icon name="up-right"/></a></div></section>
  <section class="section journey-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">HOW WE WORK WITH YOU</p><h2>One requirement.<br/><em>Four practical stages.</em></h2></div><p>The exact scope is agreed for each engagement. Here is a starting point for the conversation.</p></div><div class="journey-grid">{[
    {n:'01',title:'Define the work',text:'Share the roles, number of people, skills, location, and preferred start period. We discuss duties and employment conditions to build a useful brief.',you:'A role description, headcount, and work location.'},
    {n:'02',title:'Find the fit',text:'Candidates are sourced, interviewed, screened, and considered against the brief. Selection discussions help clarify experience and suitability.',you:'Assessment criteria and selection feedback.'},
    {n:'03',title:'Agree & coordinate',text:'Confirm the engagement, responsibilities, and documentation. Visa and travel coordination may be included where applicable and agreed.',you:'Agreed terms and the required employer information.'},
    {n:'04',title:'Prepare to welcome',text:'Discuss practical arrival arrangements and the working relationship. Confirm the scope of any employee or workforce support.',you:'Induction, supervision, and workplace arrangements.'},
  ].map(stage=><article data-reveal><span class="journey-number">{stage.n}</span><h3>{stage.title}</h3><p>{stage.text}</p><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR INPUT</span><p>{stage.you}</p></div></article>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="section container checklist-layout" id="checklist"><div data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">A BETTER FIRST CONVERSATION</p><h2>A little preparation.<br/><em>A clearer starting point.</em></h2><p class="measure">You don’t need every answer to get in touch. These details help us understand the requirement and identify what needs to be discussed next.</p><a class="text-link" href="/employer-checklist.txt" download>Download the employer checklist <Icon name="download" size={20}/></a></div><ul class="numbered-checklist">{['Roles, duties, and skills needed','Headcount and preferred start period','Work location and expected duration','Hours, shifts, rest days, and supervision','Proposed pay and employment conditions','Accommodation, meals, and transport','Safety induction and workplace requirements'].map((item,i)=><li><span>0{i+1}</span>{item}<Icon name="check" size={18}/></li>)}</ul></section>
  <section class="responsibility-band"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE MAKING A COMMITMENT</p><h2>Clarity protects <em>everyone.</em></h2><div class="responsibility-grid"><p>Confirm fees, responsibilities, employment terms, and support arrangements in writing before an engagement proceeds.</p><p>For international recruitment, confirm the applicable permissions and immigration route with the appropriate authorities. Coordination does not guarantee an approval.</p><p>Keep personal documents secure. Use the initial enquiry for your business requirement; avoid sending passports, medical records, or other sensitive documents.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="container official-guidance"><div><p class="eyebrow">OFFICIAL INFORMATION</p><p>The Department of Immigration and Emigration publishes residence visa categories, including employment. Check the applicable route for your employer and roles before making a commitment.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="https://www.immigration.gov.lk/pages_e.php?id=18" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read official visa guidance <Icon name="up-right" size={18}/><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></section>
  <section class="section container faq-layout" id="questions"><div><p class="eyebrow">COMMON QUESTIONS</p><h2>Know what<br/><em>comes next.</em></h2><p class="measure">Something specific to your business?<br/>Let’s talk through it.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Ask the team <Icon/></a></div><FAQ/></section><CTA/>
</Layout>
